:''This article is about the Cat Unit. For the enemies, see [[Great Ape Luza]] and [[Zero Luza]].''
'''Ancient Egg: N000''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] that is unlocked when beating [[Revival of Origin]]. It was added in [[Version 12.0 Update|Version 12.0]]. [[True Form]] also added in Version 12.0 gains [[Behemoth Slayer]], [[Long Distance]] attacks, various immunities, much higher overall stats, 1 less speed and [[Multi-Hit]].

