==Trivia==
*Ancient Egg: N000's triple-zero numbering may be an allusion to [[Zero Luza]] and [[Zero Legends]].
*It is currently the only Ancient Egg with an identifier code of N00X not to drop from an [[Empress' Research|Empress' Excavation]] map and the only Ancient Egg whose [[True Form]]'s English name does not contain the word "Cat".
*It is the only [[:Category:Mythic Cats|Mythic Cat]] whose [[Meow Medals|Meow Medal]] shows its True Form rather than its Normal Form and the only [[Uncanny Legends]] drop unit to have no preview shown when entering [[Legend Stages]], due to being a non-functional unit in its Normal Form as opposed to the others.
*Although it sounds similar to ''loser'', the name Luza (ルーザ ''Rūza'') is most likely derived from the Japanese word for monkey (猿 ''saru''), which becomes ''zaru'' in certain compound words due to ''[[wikipedia:Rendaku|rendaku]]''.
*It is the only Uncanny Legends drop unit whose True Form does not gain [[Colossus Slayer]].
*In the German translation, Ape Lord Luza's name is "Affenlord Uza" (translates to "Apelord Uza"), which is notably missing the "L" from its original name.

